<title>BRAZIL: Brazil orange juice industry reports weekly output.</title>
<headline>Brazil orange juice industry reports weekly output.</headline>
<dateline>RIO DE JANEIRO 1996-12-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Brazilian Association of Citrus Exporters reported the following output and exports of frozen concentrated orange juice in tonnes 66 Brix for December 2 to December 8 and the total so far in 1996/97.</p>
<p>		   Dec 2-Dec 8  Dec 4-Dec 10     TOTAL	  TOTAL</p>
<p>			  1996	 1995	    1996	   1995</p>
<p> Stocks/open    463,919.3   395,531.2</p>
<p> Production	44,700.3    45,874.1     866,608.6   685,279.0</p>
<p> Shipment	  16,627.2     8,012.3     537,323.0   379,097.8</p>
<p> Home Market	  575.2	 329.9	 7,316.2     9,168.2</p>
<p> Stocks/close   491,417.2   433,063.1</p>
<p>-- Joelle Diderich, Rio de Janeiro newsroom, 5521 5074151</p>
</text>
